Deposit_ERC4626_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when assets zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when assets non zero
   ├── when yieldVault not allowlisted
   │  └── it should revert with VaultNotAllowed
   └── when yieldVault allowlisted
      ├── given vault has not approved adapter for asset
      │  └── it should revert on transferFrom
      └── given vault approved adapter for at least assets
         ├── when reentered through token transfer hook
         │  └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
         └── when not reentered
            ├── it should pull assets from vault
            ├── it should call yieldVault.deposit with receiver equal to vault
            ├── it should reset asset allowance to zero
            ├── it should leave zero asset in adapter
            ├── it should grow vault share balance
            └── it should return non zero sharesReceived
